food_ingredients:abiyuch a off:FoodIngredient ;
    skos:broader food_ingredients:fruit ;
    skos:definition "Abiyuch comes from Crateva religiosa, commonly known as the sacred garlic pear or temple plant. It's a species of flowering tree that belongs to the caper family."@en ;
