    skos:definition "Nance is a small tropical fruit native to Central America, the Caribbean, and parts of South America. Small, round, yellow to orange berries, about 1–2 cm in diameter, growing in clusters. It has a very distinctive, pungent aroma and a flavor that's a unique mix of sweet, sour, and slightly cheesy or fermented."@en ;
