        "HARISSA is a Tunisian hot chili pepper paste, the main ingredients of which are roasted red peppers, Baklouti pepper, serrano peppers, and other hot chili peppers, spices and herbs such as garlic paste, coriander seed, saffron, rose, or caraway, as well as some vegetable or olive oil to carry the oil-soluble flavors."@en,
        "La harissa es una salsa picante y constituye uno de los ingredientes más comunes en la gastronomía magrebí."@es,
        "La harissa Écouter ou l'harissa est une purée de piments rouges originaire de Tunisie."@fr,
        "La harissa è una salsa tipica del Maghreb, È base di peperoncino rosso fresco e aglio, con l'aggiunta di olio d'oliva."@it,
