    skos:definition "Rapsöl oder Rüböl (auch Rübsenöl, Kolzaöl und Kohlsaatöl genannt) ist ein pflanzliches Öl, welches aus den Samen vom Raps (Brassica napus), gewonnen wird."@de,
        "Rapeseed (Brassica napus), also known as rape, or oilseed rape, is a bright-yellow flowering member of the family Brassicaceae, cultivated mainly for its oil-rich seed, which naturally contains appreciable amounts of erucic acid. Rapeseed is the third-largest source of vegetable oil and the second-largest source of protein meal in the world."@en ;
